[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-melbourne-human-rights-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-193":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},193,"university-of-melbourne-human-rights-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-193","University Of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The University of Melbourne in Australia is offering fully funded Master’s and PhD opportunities for international and home students through the Human Rights Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Melbourne \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-australia\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Australia\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Australia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$44,500 Living Stipends\u002FYr\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$3,000 Travel Grant\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: October 31, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Melbourne invites suitably qualified candidates to apply for the 2026 Human Rights Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship is offered to domestic or international students who are enrolling in a graduate research degree and undertaking research in the field of Human Rights.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Eligible applicants are selected on the basis of academic merit, the area of study in and level of commitment to human rights, and the strength of supporting documentation.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship offers;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Scholarshipapplication guides\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living allowance of $44,500 per year pro rata (2026 full-time study rate) for up to 2 years for students undertaking a Master by research degree or up to 3.5 years for students undertaking a Doctoral degree. The living allowance may be indexed annually and includes limited paid sick, maternity and parenting leave.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full fee offset for up to two years for students undertaking a Masters by Research degree or up to four years for students undertaking a doctoral degree.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Relocation grant of $2,000 for students moving from States or Territories outside Victoria or $3,000 for students moving from outside Australia.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Overseas Student Health Cover (OSHC) Single Membership for international students who require a student visa to study in Australia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Melbourne Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the University of Melbourne Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Scholarshipapplication guides\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have applied for and meet the entry requirements for a Master’s or Doctorate by research degree for commencement in the year of award\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>intend to undertake graduate research in the field of Human Rights\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have not already completed a research qualification at the same or higher level as the course for which a scholarship is sought\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have not previously received a graduate research scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Melbourne Human Rights Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the DAAD EPOS Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the button below to visit the scholarship webpage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must submit an online application and address your committed to the peaceful advancement of respect for human rights that extends beyond academic studies (such as voluntary work and\u002For work experience)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will also describe how your proposed research will further your understanding of human rights and enable you to contribute to the human rights field.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants will be notified of the outcome by email in February of the following year. Reasons for non-selection and feedback on individual applications will not be provided.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarships.unimelb.edu.au\u002Fawards\u002Fhuman-rights-scholarship\">https:\u002F\u002Fscholarships.unimelb.edu.au\u002Fawards\u002Fhuman-rights-scholarship\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-04-30 16:43:52",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-melbourne-human-rights-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69f378b876fe85.57851874_screenshot 2026-04-30 163241.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-melbourne-human-rights-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69f378b876fe85.57851874_screenshot%202026-04-30%20163241.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,38,48,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot%202026-06-24%20201924.png","2026-06-24 20:40:26","linkskool",{"id":49,"slug":50,"title":51,"images":52,"datePosted":56,"authorName":57},303,"chevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity","Chevening Scholarship 2027 Award In Uk: Fully Funded Opportunity",[53],{"fileName":54,"oldFileName":54,"type":18,"file":19,"url":55},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fchevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c2d59792500.64054757_screenshot 2026-06-24 181051.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fchevening-scholarship-2027-award-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c2d59792500.64054757_screenshot%2020